                        </span>
                        <span class="sn-jg-feat-icon" title="PD 45W USB-C" aria-label="PD 45W USB-C">
                          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="7" y="4" width="10" height="7" rx="1"/><path d="M9 11v4a3 3 0 0 0 6 0v-4M12 18v3"/></svg>
